        {
          "id": 899532609,
          "type": "DiffNote",
          "body": "Hmm, that is a good point. I'm not particularly satisfied with any solution at the moment. How about breaking out the changes for the 8.1.3.5 reserved value into another MR, and we'll go ahead and get the length octets part first.",
